{"4024930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rise In Borderland", "steam_appid": 4024930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RiseInBorderland, a competitive multiplayer game. Players gather in a lobby before facing off in a series of intense games, each based on a playing card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spades:</strong> physical challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clubs:</strong> team-based trials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diamonds:</strong> games of intelligence and logic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hearts:</strong> games of trust… and betrayal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card has a number representing its difficulty. Win matches, collect the cards, and try to unlock the ultimate challenge: the Joker’s Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond progression, earn rewards and virtual currency to customize your character and show off your unique style in the arena.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RiseInBorderland, a competitive multiplayer game. Players gather in a lobby before facing off in a series of intense games, each based on a playing card.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spades:</strong> physical challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clubs:</strong> team-based trials</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diamonds:</strong> games of intelligence and logic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hearts:</strong> games of trust… and betrayal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each card has a number representing its difficulty. Win matches, collect the cards, and try to unlock the ultimate challenge: the Joker’s Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond progression, earn rewards and virtual currency to customize your character